 un'amicizia, i due non hanno mai oltrepassato il limite. Dopo la rottura con il suo ragazzo, Nina ritorna a Biarritz, nella sua terra, con le sue due migliori amiche. Che non tarderanno a farle capire che il vero amore della sua vita è...Dylan.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Son meilleur ami... Ou l'amour de sa vie ?","language":"fr-FR"},"releaseDate":"2021-03-26","status":"Released","rating":5.527,"ratingCount":164,"genres":["Commedia","Romance"],"countries":["France"],"facts":{"Runtime":"100m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":2524776,"name":"Inès Reg","role":"Nina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nJqgnf58sZDxAE00rJkdJ3g3NLm.jpg"},{"id":2988160,"name":"Kévin Debonne","role":"Dylan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4KnLYywJSbjPmqIoZzwBKzPHalP.jpg"},{"id":2215193,"name":"Laurie Peret","role":"Chacal","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iHV7QPyuKrjk1ul6dWH9qdi6GXG.jpg"},{"id":2112198,"name":"Pauline Clément","role":"Lulu","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nHAaTn6N7yIFWxcgwylIGZDLiC6.jpg"},{"id":83798,"name":"Anthony Sonigo","role":"Jules","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kfepmApUK9DDU6fZRIi1MSP0Jop.jpg"},{"id":1885445,"name":"Constance Labbé","role":"Cassandra","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jdZTA080OxQnSlARV8oFXDVUzrL.jpg"},{"id":26401,"name":"Michèle Garcia","role":"Mère de Dylan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kBAMyg3X93hRrZjEgaBPSf8bbFD.jpg"},{"id":180962,"name":"Fadila Belkebla","role":"Mère de Nina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2sv7OUg4lD14ZMvwAmoDiuK4KX0.jpg"},{"id":1407367,"name":"Pierre Cévaër","role":"Benoît Pitavy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7tWEI7s8USICKYUv6e6y0QipoNJ.jpg"},{"id":3950211,"name":"Médine","role":"Le Juge","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v28ZCcjR2HLafd4d1leDRObZhSS.jpg"},{"id":2832358,"name":"Laura Felpin","role":"La Caissière","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jSDgeJhj46YmeXTl3J0sYWAI175.jpg"},{"id":4176145,"name":"Anaïs Delareg","role":"Dame de la fourrière"},{"id":4176147,"name":"Mohamed Mehdaoui","role":"Collègue avocat Nina"},{"id":4176151,"name":"Mickael Montadir","role":"Jardinier / Serveur restaurant/ Suceur de pommes"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Nemmeno io ti voglio","overview":"Nina e Dylan sono amici d'infanzia e hanno condiviso tutti i momenti della loro vita, anche quelli più intimi. Sebbene Dylan abbia sempre sognato più di un'amicizia, i due non hanno mai oltrepassato il limite. Dopo la rottura con il suo ragazzo, Nina ritorna a Biarritz, nella sua terra, con le sue due migliori amiche. Che non tarderanno a farle capire che il vero amore della sua vita è...Dylan."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Nina and Dylan, best friends since childhood, have no secrets from each other. Nina now lives in Paris, while Dylan lives in Biarritz. Dylan always thought they'd end up together, but has never seriously taken a chance on Nina, since she laughs at him every time he mentions a future together. When Nina leaves her boyfriend and decides to go to Biarritz for an impromptu vacation with her two best friends, something finally clicks. Dylan has just started a relationship with her latest date, and Nina realizes that he's the one for her! Full of twists and turns, their love story is going to be much more complicated than expected."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Nina et Dylan, meilleurs amis depuis l’enfance, n’ont aucun secret l’un pour l’autre. Désormais, Nina vit à Paris tandis que Dylan habite à Biarritz. Dylan a toujours pensé qu’ils finiraient ensemble mais n’a jamais sérieusement tenté sa chance auprès de Nina puisqu’elle se moque de lui à chaque fois qu’il évoque un avenir ensemble. Quand Nina quitte son petit ami et décide de partir à Biarritz pour des vacances improvisées avec ses deux meilleures amies, elle a finalement un déclic. Alors que Dylan vient de débuter une relation avec sa dernière rencontre, Nina réalise que c’est bel et bien lui l’homme de sa vie ! Pleine de rebondissements, leur histoire d’amour va être beaucoup plus compliquée que prévu…","tagline":"Son meilleur ami... Ou l'amour de sa vie ?"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uH5P2V2mESZ3t0HEDeMkqsxUrU3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nzYrvTPZHgu1e21vrWyL95AY40N.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":799844,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uH5P2V2mESZ3t0HEDeMkqsxUrU3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uH5P2V2mESZ3t0HEDeMkqsxUrU3.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uH5P2V2mESZ3t0HEDeMkqsxUrU3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uH5P2V2mESZ3t0HEDeMkqsxUrU3.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8eevR507AolRD8w45TnJKaRmyDm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8eevR507AolRD8w45TnJKaRmyDm.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8eevR507AolRD8w45TnJKaRmyDm.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8eevR507AolRD8w45TnJKaRmyDm.jpg","language":"fr","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/foifFZwb0mIiphySC26GbhLwPye.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/foifFZwb0mIiphySC26GbhLwPye.jpg","language":"fr","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fyRQU6I5quOazrXix2XJ0AiNJ5K.jpg","pr